{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "b00cffbb9b66efcbcf9ac20182e06d70c7aeb45b4f101b40412ba3347307e3d7", "ja": "夢を初めて願った日から", "zh": "从初次许下梦想的那天起", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "69d675d702d14af6a10813a6bff27c739b60e3f6613962cf017a0ea1466afb25", "ja": "合宿中、朝練に励む可奈は一期生なのに\n歌が上達しないことを詫びてくる。しかし\nプロデューサーは、誰よりも長く頑張り\n続けている可奈の素晴らしさと、出会いに\n改めてありがとうを伝えるのだった。", "zh": "合宿期间，正在晨练的可奈为自己明明是一期生，\n唱歌却没有进步而道歉。然而\n制作人不仅肯定了比谁都更长久地坚持\n努力的可奈有多棒，还向她再次表达了\n相遇的感谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1000_null", "source_sha256": "6cc162e6064635d0cf52761231fafa406aa2457f92a62715fd8bdf14a6d7ed15", "ja": "劇場での合宿中、朝……", "zh": "剧场合宿期间的早晨……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1001_401pro", "source_sha256": "132c638b1fd84934ded4f6a5cfdf02037738c57fae71b1621f5062f4e28cb57a", "ja": "ふわぁ……早めに起きちゃったな……。\nみんなまだ寝てるだろうし、散歩でもするか……。", "zh": "哈啊……不小心醒得有点早了……  \n大家应该还在睡吧，去散散步好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "35481a0f1be774c1d85257b9608235918257f07f60590f87cf5187cffdaa9691", "ja": "……ん？　あそこにいるのは……。", "zh": "……嗯？在那边的人是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "27459c85832076ae0bdc3744c1ba9380e8bd0747a2acfad751e96ffc7366543d", "ja": "太陽さんさん、スズメさん～♪\nお魚さんにも、おはようさ～ん♪", "zh": "太阳灿灿，小麻雀～♪\n也跟小鱼说声，早上好～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "be659e97f80deeca52b666553c62b8b8ca0f49cef0db11135ab94664d1d1fc4e", "ja": "あ、プロデューサーさん！\nおはようございまーす！", "zh": "啊，制作人先生！\n早上好——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1005_401pro", "source_sha256": "ca3b8ca21ef47dd544f3df8047966b87320781d4bb1807c8dd286620c6c3ddd0", "ja": "おはよう、可奈！\nすいぶん早起きだな。可奈も散歩してたのか？", "zh": "早上好，可奈！  \n你起得真早啊。可奈也在散步吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "d656ea3778522a069fcdcc7286f4292584a5045e3c1e466d4cd2bc6909207058", "ja": "いえ、朝練です！　レッスンルームはまだみんなが\n寝てるから、ここで歌うのがいいかな～って。", "zh": "不是哦，是早晨训练！练习室里大家还都在睡觉，所以我想着，在这里唱歌应该比较好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1007_401pro", "source_sha256": "53336d474695367c6fe12f72c896971470bdb5b8a1f472a7a8d6cc4f2903ab76", "ja": "へえ、こんな朝から……。\n熱心なのはいいけど、無理するんじゃないぞ？", "zh": "哦，这么早就开始了啊……。\n热心是好事，但可别勉强自己啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "e6cf9bd490098d5e9c978b1f0f2e116917e42d2e712902ab9459c5333a3233ea", "ja": "はーい♪　でも大丈夫ですよ？　朝に練習すると、\nすっごく気持ちがいいし、ご飯も美味しくなるし。", "zh": "好——♪不过没关系的哦？早上练习的话，感觉特别舒服，饭也会变得更香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "fe5fea9a2aa5528df7cc503ea8df5c9ea949a662be7a0f172930fc85829c604c", "ja": "あと、早起きの練習にもなるかな～って……。\nえへへ、お仕事で寝坊したら大変ですもんね！", "zh": "而且，我还想着这样也能练习早起～……\n嘿嘿，要是在工作时睡过头就糟糕了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1010_401pro", "source_sha256": "a00c257142819475eaad37b49d4f8d03690adf7c700559abcf732a5c783ace25", "ja": "おっ、そうだな。\nまあ、可奈の元気の素になってるならいいんだ。", "zh": "哦，这样啊。\n嘛，只要能成为可奈精神满满的源泉就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "61ecdec096ac32982e06c4240ef9bec052a4c2d30e1d4088c93e5d1522e29a31", "ja": "あ、そうだ！　今の私の歌、どうでした？\n少しはうまくなってました？？", "zh": "啊，对了！我刚才唱得怎么样？\n有没有稍微进步一点？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1012_401pro", "source_sha256": "e14b406b29991e480dcefe2addb08b3dc0894922a255ad5bc33734bdc2392cda", "ja": "えっ？　えーっと……うん、うまいというより、\n元気で自由で、笑顔になれたかな。", "zh": "诶？这个嘛……嗯，与其说唱得好，\n不如说很有活力、很自由，让人不由得露出了笑容吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "10dc6d44fba8c95a2b1cd4dde89f32451d32cbf93a9e9bd3661813d33999ccb7", "ja": "……。それってつまり、あんまりうまくない、\nってことですよね。そっかぁ～……。", "zh": "……也就是说，就是不太好吃，对吧。这样啊～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1014_401pro", "source_sha256": "cbcb1f8c0bda973f5d0826e0c13182fe7eb096440c31956996dfd64337073a04", "ja": "え？　あ、いや、それは……。", "zh": "咦？啊，不是，我不是那个意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "c41083d3ff9361cb26083c9979ff428e185f62a116d20ad1fd3aa6100eb1fd12", "ja": "じゃあ、もっともっと、たくさん歌いますね！\n太陽さんさん、たくさん歌お～♪", "zh": "那我就唱更多更多的歌给你听吧！\n在阳光灿烂下，尽情歌唱吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1016_401pro", "source_sha256": "9e4704ea65337c3997f0a63b8c0b1591e1e8e32dd91eae7de9759c4933e04177", "ja": "可奈……。", "zh": "可奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "f4ed2fcfd7dba22fd5c4ce8b561c7eecbd975538f6156fbd70e4f4c95d95b03a", "ja": "……プロデューサーさん。\n私、なかなか上手になれなくて、ごめんなさいっ。", "zh": "……制作人先生。\n我一直都唱不好，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "b8bc54712de0ab3e1d1703fc3b601106090e7450877efbb17309228748544bbe", "ja": "一期生で劇場に入れてもらえたのに、\n最初からずーっと、今でもへたっぴなままで……。", "zh": "明明作为一期生被选进了剧场，却从一开始直到现在，都一直这么笨手笨脚的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "4557ec7139bc26f84085bbf70b4161d7d1887ecce3fbd4612f1de8f5875251ca", "ja": "なのに、Team7thに入れてもらえて。\nジュリアさんも麗花さんも歩さんも、すごく上手で！", "zh": "可我却被选进了Team7th。  \n茱莉亚、丽花和步都特别厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "0d318689372dafae837d8f420d956f780789e18b8319dd956ccca15837428086", "ja": "私だけどうしよう～、とかも思いましたけど……\nでも、それより嬉しかったです！", "zh": "我也想过，就我一个人该怎么办啊～……\n不过，比起那个，更多的还是开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "64e6539a840598577b71da2ca37a024a85e67755492e4085cd25eac66895943e", "ja": "だから、もっともっと嬉しくなれるように！\n私、頑張りますね！", "zh": "所以，为了能变得更加更加开心！\n我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1022_401pro", "source_sha256": "2ef201595347e8a0f5e269fb4a2ddbe159e08d1a5c6b03e19f2a38254b8837a1", "ja": "……うん。\nやっぱり、可奈はすごいな。", "zh": "……嗯。\n可奈果然很厉害啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "617860d64a7f10949dc5ebe9081e1d497109a5ec55f4dc763af05766a1b3a172", "ja": "……え？　あ、いえ！　私だけすごくないから、\nすごくなれるように、頑張ろうって……！", "zh": "……诶？啊，不是！不是只有我一个人很厉害，所以我想努力变得更厉害……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1024_401pro", "source_sha256": "cfe3a6e1b7503666d42dce05724d28025b891ba48d9c79427c1c547971c41578", "ja": "そうだよ。可奈はずっと頑張ってくれてる。\n落ち込んでうつむいても、しっかり顔を上げて。", "zh": "就是这样。可奈一直都在努力。\n即使沮丧地低下头，也还是坚定地抬起头来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1025_401pro", "source_sha256": "c24d203c194cc524d58362b30efb085772df3c7305c1a0c2b187d19892b8a07c", "ja": "そうやって、ここまで走り続けてくれた。\n一期生として、きっと劇場の誰よりも長い距離を。", "zh": "就这样，一直奔跑到了这里。作为一期生，肯定比剧场里的任何人都跑过更长的路。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1026_401pro", "source_sha256": "a26dbe9021513d7968994d4403a5c21e61f85a322b53daf16308aa3c79d899cf", "ja": "ありがとう。最初に扉をたたいてくれて……\n最初のバトンを持ってきてくれて。", "zh": "谢谢你。谢谢你最初敲响了那扇门……\n带来了第一棒接力棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1027_401pro", "source_sha256": "36b0e4a0fc1596fcaeaab2ef94a1039cea86dca1d5338b446ebe05e6fda3f981", "ja": "可奈が来てくれて、本当に……\n本当によかった。", "zh": "可奈能来，真的……\n真的太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "9121ce377423010ce8ed5bb243ef683fd901d69507c400df08c2cf84caa7fce6", "ja": "……。\nプロデューサーさん……。", "zh": "……。\n制作人……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1029_036kan", "source_sha256": "b29ec5831d473d501e398e3f05f84750a1e7f04f9566b860c09d1b24908b1497", "ja": "え、えへ……えへへ。すごく褒められちゃった……♪\nあの、ありがとうございますっ！", "zh": "诶、诶嘿……嘿嘿。被夸得太厉害了……♪\n那个，谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "9a488194c06117434eb13915d77d21e94a2313a7c62f0e7a2145321c59306ec6", "ja": "私でも、ちょっとだけでも、役に立てたのなら……\nちょっとだけ自信、持っちゃいますね！", "zh": "如果连我也能帮上一点点忙的话……我就忍不住有点自信了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1031_401pro", "source_sha256": "86d87a6081398646131ffee125442d04eb4b61e1085f3d6203800a43cccd9ac4", "ja": "ああ、たっぷり持ってくれ。\nそのまま胸を張って、最後のバトン、頼んだぞ！", "zh": "啊，那就尽管自信满满吧。\n就这样抬头挺胸，最后一棒就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1032_036kan", "source_sha256": "eeca2445cb66e93de1ddcce3759dada9fc33f82e43c5f0485ac015361cc50067", "ja": "最後のバトン……！\nはいっ！", "zh": "最后的接力棒……！\n好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1033_036kan", "source_sha256": "f2d700bc07852b0acc0830479c65f6a87f34d1cc1b392f41419831bf7a7783da", "ja": "バトンをキャッチ～、みんなにタッチ～♪\nバッチリ渡すぞ、ゴーゴゴー♪", "zh": "接住接力棒～，和大家击掌～♪\n完美交出去，冲冲冲♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0327_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_02_1034_036kan", "source_sha256": "f0ed24f7ab46d8610674569aeddafb99dc380f2d5765c94a3bf9caa407c4ebab", "ja": "あの、私、やっぱり頑張ることしかできないですけど\n……たくさんたくさん、頑張ります！", "zh": "那个，虽然我果然还是只会努力……\n但我会非常非常努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
